      "template_ids": [
        "2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.9"
      ],
      "narrative": "• 1. Palpitations / Premature ventricular contractions (ICD-10 I49.3): Ordered 14-day ambulatory continuous ECG patch monitor.\n• 2. Systolic ejection murmur (ICD-10 R01.1): Ordered Transthoracic Echocardiogram (TTE) with Doppler to evaluate aortic valve morphology and ventricular function.\n• 3. Essential Hypertension (ICD-10 I10): Blood pressure today is 134/86 mmHg. Continue Amlodipine 5mg and HCTZ 12.5mg daily. Keep home BP log.\n• 4. Follow-up: Return to clinic in 4 weeks after completion of Holter monitor and echocardiogram.",
